[rexglue-native] SDK 0301: native render targets (Vulkan host render targets). UNTESTED.

Base: the SDK pin 9c444189 with the 0300 draft (native render-target census) applied.
Written by rexglue-native-think on 2026-11-02; nothing was compiled or run.

Files (md5 before -> after):
  include/rex/graphics/pipeline/render_target/cache.h  047bffeaeb009cf72b17320349548c2d -> 942620cc9dcd98b2b3a0903219786bc3
  src/graphics/pipeline/render_target/cache.cpp        d1be14b58df694b972758049efa3fb9d -> 033cacfe2e99c79a2914d73dd0a709ff
  include/rex/graphics/vulkan/render_target_cache.h    b9827934f54e9f1c9ade547f4820eee1 -> d1996f9fa450fc3c12dc30efdb63fea4
